# Week 3+ RL artifacts (models, VecNormalize stats, learning curves,
# manifests) -- regenerable from a config + training seed + git commit, per
# each run's manifest.json (see thesis_docs/chapters/03_rl_baseline.md).
experiments/phase2_algorithms/models/

# Week 4 oracle artifacts (day-config copies, raw and G2V-forced replay
# pickles) -- regenerable from a config + day + scenario_seed via
# ev2gym_thesis/oracle/replay_utils.py, not meant to be committed. Gurobi
# .log/.lp dumps are covered by the *.lp/*.mps rules above.
experiments/phase4_oracle/configs/_tmp_oracle_day_configs/
experiments/phase4_oracle/replays_raw/
experiments/phase4_oracle/replays_g2v/

